408
00:25:27,324 --> 00:25:30,967
[SPEAKER_00]: Am I... am I thinking thoughts that are just unrestrained, sensual?

409
00:25:31,067 --> 00:25:38,352
[SPEAKER_00]: Am I thinking thoughts that are maybe not... not sensual, but careless, harmful to me, to others?

410
00:25:38,959 --> 00:25:41,904
[SPEAKER_00]: And then not do it on that mental level either, because it is a choice as well.

411
00:25:41,944 --> 00:25:45,991
[SPEAKER_00]: It's just most people are not aware of that choice, because they're not even aware of the bodily choices they make.

412
00:25:47,814 --> 00:25:50,258
